{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015Even if that love is a blade that tears apart the \u201cnow.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c...Let's stay together forever, okay? No matter how many years pass... I want to keep playing with you...\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c...Because I won't let you go.\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words I've heard somewhere before. Words someone said to me long ago.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious academy deep in the mountains, far from the city.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, only one thing is measured: whether one possesses the innate potential for pathological love.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As academy life progresses, what seemed like a peaceful existence transforms into days of blood-soaked mountains of corpses and rivers of blood\u2015\u2015\u2015. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Game Introduction\u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe demo version offers approximately one hour of playtime, allowing you to progress through the common route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis is a text adventure in visual novel format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEvery character who appears is a paranoid, obsessive lover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086580?t=1761285724","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086580?t=1761285724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086580/c65cd1146380128dffd43632e9c179e561838939/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761285724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086580/c65cd1146380128dffd43632e9c179e561838939/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=176